0.195 [0.166, 0.227], raw-flatten 0.013 [0.007, 0.019] and conv-AE 0.008 [0.002, 0.016]. Only
the raw-flatten and conv-AE intervals overlap. Seed variation is the smaller of the two
quantities: across the ten seeds the $k$-means solutions move by less than 0.002 in ARI and are
